1"><p begin="9.997" end="15.238" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.997" end="10.351">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="10.351" end="10.558">pave</span> <span begin="10.558" end="10.993">it</span> <span begin="10.993" end="13.195">out,</span> <span begin="13.195" end="13.588">whoa-</span><span begin="13.588" end="15.238">oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">铺设坐标</span></p><p begin="16.114" end="19.846" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.114" end="18.355">Whoa-</span><span begin="18.355" end="18.589">oh-</span><span begin="18.589" end="18.766">oh-</span><span begin="18.766" end="19.846">oh</span></p><p begin="20.359" end="25.951" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.359" end="20.637">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="20.637" end="20.877">pave</span> <span begin="20.877" end="21.264">it</span> <span begin="21.264" end="23.541">out,</span> <span begin="23.541" end="23.931">whoa-</span><span begin="23.931" end="25.951">oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拓宽航道</span></p><p begin="26.513" end="30.356" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.513" end="28.682">Oh-</span><span begin="28.682" end="29.066">whoa-</span><span begin="29.066" end="30.356">oh</span></p><p begin="30.697" end="31.654" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.697" end="30.978">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="30.978" end="31.351">pave</span> <span begin="31.351" end="31.552">it</span> <span begin="31.552" end="31.654">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将跨越星海</span></p><p begin="44.607" end="53.065" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.607" end="46.362">What&apos;s</span> <span begin="46.362" end="47.133">stret</span><span begin="47.133" end="47.736">ching</span> <span begin="47.736" end="48.390">so</span> <span begin="48.390" end="49.119">far</span> <span begin="49.119" end="50.139">along,</span> <span begin="52.005" end="53.065">oh~</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那无限延伸而出的</span></p><p begin="54.584" end="1:03.347" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.584" end="54.973">The</span> <span begin="54.973" end="56.701">ra</span><span begin="56.701" end="56.961">ils</span> <span begin="56.961" end="57.521">or</span> <span begin="57.521" end="58.769">our</span> <span begin="58.769" end="59.361">mu</span><span begin="59.361" end="59.683">tual</span> <span begin="59.683" end="1:00.713">bond,</span> <span begin="1:02.367" end="1:03.347">whoa~</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是星轨，还是彼此联结的共鸣？</span></p><p begin="1:04.939" end="1:07.284" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.939" end="1:05.239">We</span> <span begin="1:05.239" end="1:05.740">track</span> <span begin="1:05.740" end="1:06.367">through</span> <span begin="1:06.367" end="1:06.561">the</span> <span begin="1:06.561" end="1:07.036">quiet</span> <span begin="1:07.036" end="1:07.284">land</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这片静寂废墟中穿行</span></p><p begin="1:07.475" end="1:10.623" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.475" end="1:07.691">To</span> <span begin="1:07.691" end="1:08.463">carry</span> <span begin="1:08.463" end="1:09.058">us</span> <span begin="1:09.058" end="1:09.396">across</span> <span begin="1:09.396" end="1:09.663">the</span> <span begin="1:09.663" end="1:10.004">sand,</span> <span begin="1:10.004" end="1:10.289">you</span> <span begin="1:10.289" end="1:10.623">say</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跨过漫天星尘后，你呢喃道:</span></p><p begin="1:10.751" end="1:12.964" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.751" end="1:11.037">One</span> <span begin="1:11.037" end="1:11.371">day,</span> <span begin="1:11.371" end="1:11.699">our</span> <span begin="1:11.699" end="1:12.117">weight,</span> <span begin="1:12.117" end="1:12.292">will</span> <span begin="1:12.292" end="1:12.535">fall</span> <span begin="1:12.535" end="1:12.964">away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一日，我们会摆脱引力的束缚</span></p><p begin="1:13.213" end="1:15.405" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.213" end="1:13.413">Look</span> <span begin="1:13.413" end="1:13.830">out!</span> <span begin="1:13.830" end="1:14.253">Ride</span> <span begin="1:14.253" end="1:14.598">on,</span> <span begin="1:14.598" end="1:14.833">we</span> <span begin="1:14.833" end="1:15.045">will</span> <span begin="1:15.045" end="1:15.198">lead</span> <span begin="1:15.198" end="1:15.337">the</span> <span begin="1:15.337" end="1:15.405">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直视前方！引擎启动，我们将在此开拓前路！</span></p><p begin="1:15.575" end="1:20.337" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.575" end="1:17.667">Whoa-</span><span begin="1:17.667" end="1:17.819">oh-</span><span begin="1:17.819" end="1:18.045">oh-</span><span begin="1:18.045" end="1:20.337">oh</span></p><p begin="1:20.687" end="1:24.525" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.687" end="1:22.775">Oh-</span><span begin="1:22.775" end="1:23.118">whoa-</span><span begin="1:23.118" end="1:24.525">oh</span></p><p begin="1:24.779" end="1:29.444" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.779" end="1:25.166">I</span> <span begin="1:25.166" end="1:25.559">stand</span> <span begin="1:25.559" end="1:25.832">in</span> <span begin="1:25.832" end="1:26.249">pro</span><span begin="1:26.249" end="1:26.531">mise,</span> <span begin="1:26.531" end="1:26.816">with</span> <span begin="1:26.816" end="1:27.074">my</span> <span begin="1:27.074" end="1:27.638">heart</span> <span begin="1:27.638" end="1:28.166">un</span><span begin="1:28.166" end="1:29.444">chained</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在此立誓，我将再无迷惘</span></p><p begin="1:29.912" end="1:34.982" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.912" end="1:30.287">No</span> <span begin="1:30.287" end="1:30.686">eyes</span> <span begin="1:30.686" end="1:30.998">will</span> <span begin="1:30.998" end="1:31.400">call</span> <span begin="1:31.400" end="1:31.694">in</span> <span begin="1:31.694" end="1:31.991">vain</span> <span begin="1:31.991" end="1:32.345">to</span> <span begin="1:32.345" end="1:32.834">say</span> <span begin="1:32.834" end="1:33.347">my</span> <span begin="1:33.347" end="1:34.982">name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些呼唤我的声音，我绝不会辜负！</span></p><p begin="1:46.605" end="1:54.960" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.605" end="1:48.171">Ju</span><span begin="1:48.171" end="1:48.519">st</span> <span begin="1:48.519" end="1:49.083">let</span> <span begin="1:49.083" end="1:49.644">those</span> <span begin="1:49.644" end="1:50.427">set</span> <span begin="1:50.427" end="1:50.769">op</span><span begin="1:50.769" end="1:51.342">tions</span> <span begin="1:51.342" end="1:52.050">come,</span> <span begin="1:53.919" end="1:54.960">oh~</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使前路既定，我们仍将面对</span></p><p begin="1:56.515" end="2:06.206" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.515" end="1:56.771">None</span> <span begin="1:56.771" end="1:58.735">will</span> <span begin="1:58.735" end="1:59.327">we</span> <span begin="1:59.327" end="2:00.035">choose</span> <span begin="2:00.035" end="2:00.858">as</span> <span begin="2:00.858" end="2:01.251">fate&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:01.251" end="2:01.677">out</span><span begin="2:01.677" end="2:02.421">come,</span> <span begin="2:04.290" end="2:05.645">whoa-</span><span begin="2:05.645" end="2:05.828">oh-</span><span begin="2:05.828" end="2:06.206">oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无人愿屈从于命运终局</span></p><p begin="2:06.853" end="2:09.169" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.853" end="2:07.189">What</span> <span begin="2:07.189" end="2:07.765">we&apos;ll</span> <span begin="2:07.765" end="2:08.170">do</span> <span begin="2:08.170" end="2:08.509">and</span> <span begin="2:08.509" end="2:08.886">we&apos;ve</span> <span begin="2:08.886" end="2:09.169">done</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抗争于此刻，沿着昔日的足迹</span></p><p begin="2:09.394" end="2:11.641" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.394" end="2:09.568">To</span> <span begin="2:09.568" end="2:10.021">seek</span> <span begin="2:10.021" end="2:10.330">the</span> <span begin="2:10.330" end="2:10.693">souls</span> <span begin="2:10.693" end="2:11.026">we</span> <span begin="2:11.026" end="2:11.356">left</span> <span begin="2:11.356" end="2:11.641">afar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻回那些散落深空的意志</span></p><p begin="2:11.686" end="2:12.538" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.686" end="2:12.112">Press</span> <span begin="2:12.112" end="2:12.538">on</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全速进发</span></p><p begin="2:12.652" end="2:13.886" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.652" end="2:12.947">Engrave</span> <span begin="2:12.947" end="2:13.238">that</span> <span begin="2:13.238" end="2:13.496">in</span> <span begin="2:13.496" end="2:13.694">your</span> <span begin="2:13.694" end="2:13.886">mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将誓言铭刻于心</span></p><p begin="2:14.078" end="2:15.196" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.078" end="2:14.296">We</span> <span begin="2:14.296" end="2:14.500">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:14.500" end="2:14.708">leave</span> <span begin="2:14.708" end="2:14.882">one</span> <span begin="2:14.882" end="2:15.196">behind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不遗落任何一人！</span></p><p begin="2:15.314" end="2:16.455" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.314" end="2:15.503">Our</span> <span begin="2:15.503" end="2:15.928">way&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:15.928" end="2:16.093">un</span><span begin="2:16.093" end="2:16.455">defined</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然前路未定</span></p><p begin="2:16.440" end="2:17.524" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span be